<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-NATAL BEAT WELLINGTON 29-24.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NATAL BEAT WELLINGTON 29-24.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natal beat Wellington 29-24</p>
<p>(halftime 9-14) in their Super 12 match at Kings Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Natal - Tries: Geoff Appleford, penalty try. Conversions:</p>
<p>Gavin Lawless (2). Penalties: Lawless (5).</p>
<p>Wellington - Tries: Stephen Bachop, Norm Hewitt, Tana Umaga.</p>
<p>Conversions: Jon Preston (3). Penalties: Preston.</p>
</text>
